   "text": {
    "L1": "Daadi wrote to Vikram and Vaibhavi after her natural cures helped them get better.",
    "L2": "She shared more benefits of spices found in the kitchen.",
    "L3": "Turmeric can help with energy and digestion. Cumin seeds soaked overnight can improve digestion and help with sleeplessness.",
    "L4": "Methi is fenugreek. Its soaked seeds can help keep sugar level and weight in control.",
    "L5": "Cinnamon and clove can give relief from toothache until we see a dentist.",
    "L6": "Spices may help, but they do not cure every illness. You must consult an elder before using them.",
    "L7": "These cures pass through generations because Daadi learnt them from her grandmother and teaches her grandchildren.",
    "L8": "A modal takes a plain verb: must consult, should rest, or can help.",
    "L9": "Now choose the word that completes the safety advice."
   },
